  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:330px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-lightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Personal Absorption Manipulation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/BuuAbsorb.png/revision/latest?cb=20121215195638\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"BuuAbsorb\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/BuuAbsorb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20121215195638\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/BuuAbsorb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20121215195638 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/BuuAbsorb.png/revision/latest?cb=20121215195638 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"BuuAbsorb\" width=\"270\" height=\"364\" data-image-key=\"BuuAbsorb.png\" data-image-name=\"BuuAbsorb.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Super Buu (Dragon Ball Z) can control his absorption process, eating and killing most of his victims while absorbing Gotenks and Piccolo to gain their power.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Manipulate one's absorption capabilities.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"The amazing Mister Absorbency!\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― SpongeBob SquarePants (SpongeBob SquarePants)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The power to <b>manipulate one's own absorption capabilities</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Manipulation\">Absorption Manipulation</a>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Mastery\" title=\"Personal Mastery\">Personal Mastery</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Base\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Base</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Signature\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Signature</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Anime/Manga/Manhwa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Cartoons\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cartoons</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonal_Absorption_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Personal Absorption</li>\n<li>Personal Assimilation</li>\n<li>Self-Absorption/Assimilation Manipulation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonal_Absorption_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user has complete control over their absorption capabilities, able to choose what/who to absorb, the rate at which it happens, whether or not it happens at all, etc.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonal_Absorption_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Base\">Base</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonal_Absorption_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li>All <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Absorption\" title=\"Category:Absorption\">Absorption powers</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Signature\">Signature</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonal_Absorption_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Vortex_Creation\" title=\"Absorbing Vortex Creation\">Absorbing Vortex Creation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Omni-Absorption\">Omni-Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Arts\" title=\"Absorption Arts\">Absorption Arts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Attacks\" title=\"Absorption Attacks\">Absorption Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Empowerment\" title=\"Absorption Empowerment\">Absorption Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Ball_Projection\" title=\"Absorption Ball Projection\">Absorption Ball Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Beam_Emission\" title=\"Absorption Beam Emission\">Absorption Beam Emission</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Combat\" title=\"Absorption Combat\">Absorption Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Defense\" title=\"Absorption Defense\">Absorption Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Energy Manipulation\">Absorption Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Field_Projection\" title=\"Absorption Field Projection\">Absorption Field Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Infusion\" title=\"Absorption Infusion\">Absorption Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Magic\" title=\"Absorption Magic\">Absorption Magic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Power_Link\" title=\"Absorption Power Link\">Absorption Power Link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Slash\" title=\"Absorption Slash\">Absorption Slash</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Accelerated_Assimilation\" title=\"Accelerated Assimilation\">Accelerated Assimilation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Evolution\" title=\"Assimilative Evolution\">Assimilative Evolution</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Immunity\" title=\"Assimilation Immunity\">Assimilation Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonal_Absorption_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Mastery\" title=\"Personal Mastery\">Personal Mastery</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonal_Absorption_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Majin Buu (<i>Dragon Ball series</i>)</li>\n<li>Naraku (<i>InuYasha</i>)</li>\n<li>SpongeBob SquarePants (<i>SpongeBob SquarePants</i>)</li>\n<li>Shirley (<i>The Jimmy/Timmy Power Hour 3: The Jerkinators</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nanatsu-no-taizai.fandom.com/wiki/Ban\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nanatsu-no-taizai:Ban\">Ban</a> (<i>Nanatsu no Taizai/The Seven Deadly Sins</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPersonal_Absorption_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><sp